#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/08-modules.md:20
#: 5b329bf3adac47f2b17fbdd97d516d99
msgid ""
"A module is a shared library loaded into the `freeswitch` process. It "
"compiles against `src/include/switch.h`, shares the core address space, "
"and extends one or more registries owned by the module loader. It is not "
"a separate process and does not communicate with the core through RPC."
msgstr ""

